  "notes": "{寒|さむ}さ is the noun form of the adjective {寒|さむ}い (cold). The suffix ～さ converts i-adjectives into nouns expressing degree or quality.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {寒|さむ}さに{耐|た}える: to endure the cold\n- {寒|さむ}さが{厳|きび}しい: the cold is severe\n- {寒|さむ}さで{震|ふる}える: to shiver from the cold\n- {寒|さむ}さに{慣|な}れる: to get used to the cold\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {暑|あつ}さ: heat (from {暑|あつ}い)\n- {暖|あたた}かさ: warmth (from {暖|あたた}かい)\n- {涼|すず}しさ: coolness (from {涼|すず}しい)",
